<title>SYRIA: Syria, Lebanon to start direct telephone dialing.</title>
<headline>Syria, Lebanon to start direct telephone dialing.</headline>
<dateline>DAMASCUS 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Syria and Lebanon will start direct telephone dialing without using the international code from January one 1997, a telecommunications official said on Friday.</p>
<p>He said residents of Lebanon would be able to dial Syria by just using the code 02 plus the city code in Syria while people in Syria could reach Lebanon by dialing 06 plus the code of the city in Lebanon.</p>
<p>The international dialing code for Lebanon which is 00961 will continue to be operational in addition to the new code, the official said.</p>
</text>
